CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.0
--------------------------

NEW FEATURES

    o Initial Bioconductor submission of HuMMANet.

    o Added ExperimentHub-backed access to curated paired human
      microbiome-metabolome study resources.

    o Added study-level loading through MultiAssayExperiment and
      SummarizedExperiment containers together with annotation table
      accessors.


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.1
--------------------------

 o Updated R code chunks in HuMMANet.Rmd to enable evaluation and improve user workflow examples.


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.2
--------------------------

 o Reordered package authors to list Shivangi Verma first and
   Tarini Shankar Ghosh last.

 o Added package CITATION file for the HuMMANet bioRxiv preprint.

 o Added explicit NAMESPACE importFrom entries for all packages listed
   in DESCRIPTION Imports.


CHANGES IN VERSION 0.99.3
--------------------------

 o Updated ExperimentHub metadata SourceUrl entries to the Zenodo v3
   data record.
